text tdv11 " created this Radicle repository and signs its history: that shows the hub stored these exact bytes, not who wrote them. The person who brought it signed the list of files (<code>.interplane/brought.txt</code>, signature <code>.interplane/brought.sig</code>) with a key made on their own computer: that shows the same key vouched for exactly these files; it does not show who that person is or that they wrote the code. To check it: <code>ssh-keygen -Y check-novalidate -n interplane-bring -f &lt;their public key&gt; -s .interplane/brought.sig</code>, reading the first five lines of <code>brought.txt</code> on standard input.</p></section>"
